# Rythm Raj Studio

Rythm Raj Studio is a premium browser DJ dashboard inspired by QuickieMusic, Lexicon DJ, and DJ.Studio, built for Indian music genres and live deck performance.

## Features

- Online + offline-ready web app
- installable app support through a PWA manifest
- local music uploads for a real user library
- real deck-style control layout
- live waveform editor with drag-to-move cue markers
- BPM lock and sync behavior
- EQ and gain controls with live audio response
- timeline scrubbing for waveform-driven playback
- Electron packaging for desktop distribution

## Run locally in the browser

```bash
python -m http.server 8000
```

Then open:

```text
http://localhost:8000
```

## Run in desktop mode

Install dependencies:

```bash
npm install
```

Then start the desktop app:

```bash
npm start
```

Build desktop packages:

```bash
npm run dist
```

## Offline support

The app includes a service worker for caching the app shell and basic assets after the first load.

## Local music library

Use the Add Tracks button to load your own MP3 files for a free local DJ workflow without a backend.

## Design direction

This version is tuned toward a premium DJ software layout with real-time controls and a polished dashboard aesthetic inspired by:

- QuickieMusic
- Lexicon DJ
- DJ.Studio

